# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 领养申请表
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
msgid "领养申请表"
msgstr "Adoption Application"

msgid "请如实填写以下信息，救助站会据此与你联系并安排后续沟通。"
msgstr "Please answer the questions below honestly. The shelter will use your answers to contact you and arrange the next steps."

msgid "本次申请的动物"
msgstr "Animal in this application"

msgid "来自 %(shelter)s（%(city)s）"
msgstr "From %(shelter)s (%(city)s)"

msgid "返回详情"
msgstr "Back to details"

msgid "一、领养对象"
msgstr "1. The animal you are adopting"

msgid "已根据你查看的狗狗自动填写，如有变化可直接修改。"
msgstr "Pre-filled from the dog you were viewing; feel free to change it."

msgid "二、申请人信息"
msgstr "2. Your details"

msgid "三、家庭成员与家中宠物"
msgstr "3. Household members and pets at home"

msgid "例如：同住人 3 位，其中一位 6 岁儿童，白天家中有人。"
msgstr "For example: 3 people live here, including a 6-year-old child, and someone is home during the day."

msgid "四、希望沟通的养护话题"
msgstr "4. Care topics you would like to discuss"

msgid "勾选你希望救助站详细介绍的内容，工作人员会在沟通中逐项说明。"
msgstr "Tick the topics you would like the shelter to explain in detail; staff will go through them with you."

msgid "五、感兴趣的额外服务"
msgstr "5. Additional services you are interested in"

msgid "以下为救助站可提供的支持，勾选后我们会一并准备。"
msgstr "These are the kinds of support the shelter can provide. Tick any you would like and we will prepare them."

msgid "本表参考 Humane World for Animals 的 Adopters Welcome 样本问卷设计。"
msgstr "This form is based on the Adopters Welcome sample questionnaire from Humane World for Animals."

msgid "提交申请"
msgstr "Submit application"

msgid "取消"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "如勾选，请以收礼人的实际情况回答以下问题。"
msgstr "If checked, please answer the following questions from the point of view of the recipient."

msgid "我们欢迎租房或居住公寓的领养人。需要提醒的是，部分房东或物业可能对宠物体型、品种、数量有要求，或需要额外押金；如需协助沟通，请在下方说明，我们会提供支持。"
msgstr "We welcome adopters who rent or live in an apartment. Please note that some landlords or property managers may have size, breed or number-of-pet restrictions, or require additional deposits. If you would like help with that conversation, let us know below and we will support you."

